  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut beetroot and carrot into small chunks. Cut capsicum into large chunks.\n• Place the veggies, dukkah and a drizzle of olive oil on the lined oven tray. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.\n• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm slices (you should get 3-4 pieces per person). In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649389e92a47cf9ab0a1c978-5caaa85b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt butter over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water and bring to the boil. Add couscous.\n• Stir to combine, cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and season to taste. Set aside, uncovered.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649389e92a47cf9ab0a1c978-bd173004.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Drain haloumi and pat dry with paper towel. Cook until golden brown, 2 mins each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, add honey and turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649389e92a47cf9ab0a1c978-b7b73b75.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir roast veggies through garlic couscous.\n• Divide couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi and yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649389e92a47cf9ab0a1c978-74c978a1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
